  <content contentuid="h6318d346g75dagede9gfaf1g7b5110e9aa38" version="1">Rot away a creature with your touch, dealing [1] and &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HORRIDTOUCH_POISON_PARAGON_FLARE"&gt;Poisoning&lt;/LSTag&gt; them. While poisoned in this way, the target is also &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;Blinded&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
